<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="pre-raid-best-in-slot">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c1" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/achievement_dungeon_gloryofthehero.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Pre-Raid Best in Slot for Arms Warriors</span></h2>
<div class="pad exclude-units"></div>This list represents the best overall gear available prior to entering Raids in Mist of Pandaria Classic. It's important to note that it's not required to attain this specific set of gear to carry your weight inside of raids, nor is it realistic to acquire it all, especially the world boss loot. You will be more than fine if you replace the BoE's and world boss loot with other Celestial Gear.<br/>
<br/>
