<del></del></span> Heroic Dungeon Gear for Arms Warriors</span></h2>This list represents the best gear available strictly from Heroic dungeons in Phase 3 of Mists of Pandaria Classic. With that in mind, this is not a true "best in slot" list and should instead serve as a rough guideline for what to keep an eye on from Heroic Dungeons. Keep in mind that 476 Epic items have an extremely low drop rate and are not realistic to aim for.<br/>
